# --concurrent false: three lint-staged entries write docs/spec/api.md —
# the permissions generator, the error-code generator, and `**/*.md` →
# `prettier --write`. lint-staged defaults to running every glob's
# commands at once, so a commit touching two of their inputs races them
# on one file and commits whichever write landed last. CI catches the
# stale block, but as a confusing red build rather than a clean commit.
npx lint-staged --concurrent false
